.claude
.vscode

eval/__pycache__/
eval/runs/

# Regenerable build artifacts (system.txt, prompt.txt, preset.ini, models.ini),
# produced by build-* and make build.
models/

# The working file of whoever is mid-task (see AGENTS.md). Not a repo artifact.
IMPLEMENT.md

# Personal context. The assembled prompt carries a real profile — skills,
# clients, hardware — so the working copies stay untracked and only the
# `*.example.md` templates are published.
memory/*.md
!memory/*.example.md